"purpose":"Formula field that builds a JSON-formatted string payload by concatenating other fields (email recipient {fldjzdYd3K8q0ghuo} as \"emailTo\", an email copy ID {fldLRjBXDr4ItbFhw} as \"emailCopyID\", last report date {fld5MCPbi9UD9H7tf} as \"lastReportDate\", and report IDs {fld1rPM1Hzf1FnsvB} as \"reportIDs\"). The resulting string is intended to be consumed by an automation.",
