"process":"Serves as the monthly anchor used in the ARCHR Eligibility → Individuals Sync workflow: it produces a deterministic monthly/scheduled date per individual for eligibility calculations, cutoffs, reporting or automated monthly sync actions (i.e., scheduling the Nth weekday of the month as the base date)."},{
